{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/d89ceebb315560be529e73bfb7b572f8.avif?t=1772727601\" width=1128 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plunge into a colorful, relaxing cleaning adventure in Muri: Wildwoods! Explore a mysterious island, uncover secrets, befriend cute creatures, clean away corruption, save the island\u2019s forest spirit, and restore the world\u2019s beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/f3ed978bacc0568aae7de186cfdffdc6.poster.avif?t=1772727601\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/f3ed978bacc0568aae7de186cfdffdc6.webm?t=1772727601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/f3ed978bacc0568aae7de186cfdffdc6.mp4?t=1772727601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pelle is a very curious lil' creature and surprisingly acrobatic. Run, jump, and climb your way through lush nature, <br>but also strange structures, exploring the mysterious environment around you - <i>piece by piece</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/310e4de1c5823deb0e3bc7b25c43b771.poster.avif?t=1772727601\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/310e4de1c5823deb0e3bc7b25c43b771.webm?t=1772727601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/310e4de1c5823deb0e3bc7b25c43b771.mp4?t=1772727601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use your trusty watergun and its unlockable nozzles to clean corrupted nature and its critter inhabitants in <br>satisfying ways. Watch as Wildwoods\u2019 nature restores and its vibrant colors come back to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/1ae3e3c07e3a8f948fcc066649e9b4b1.poster.avif?t=1772727601\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/1ae3e3c07e3a8f948fcc066649e9b4b1.webm?t=1772727601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/1ae3e3c07e3a8f948fcc066649e9b4b1.mp4?t=1772727601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your friends on Teamsqueak will be chatting with you through your smartwatch as you explore the island. Sometimes they can be very helpful and tell you more about things you find, and sometimes...    <br>Well, you'll see for yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/dc3ae764a13fa6aca079cbc7b431cac8.poster.avif?t=1772727601\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/dc3ae764a13fa6aca079cbc7b431cac8.webm?t=1772727601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/dc3ae764a13fa6aca079cbc7b431cac8.mp4?t=1772727601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pelle is something of an artist, or at least they aspire to be. Gather Pelle's sketches, visit vista points, and find other hidden secrets in the nooks and crannies of the beach!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/fda53f3cfebe01973367471565666e0e.poster.avif?t=1772727601\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/fda53f3cfebe01973367471565666e0e.webm?t=1772727601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/fda53f3cfebe01973367471565666e0e.mp4?t=1772727601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A great forest spirit, the Raccoonicorn, tends the island of Wildwoods. Corruption has overwhelmed the spirit, leaving it unable to fulfill its purpose of keeping the ecosystem in balance. Set out on an adventure, accompanied by helpful creatures, to set the spirit free, and restore Wildwoods together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/ea344c2413cd66247480c1944bec9af5.avif?t=1772727601\" width=1128 height=89 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1000+ items to clean.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scratches the classic platformer-itch, but gives you a bit more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of silly secrets to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing cleaning gameplay with accessibility settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yes</strong>, you can pet the critters! (<i>even hug some of the big ones</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect lore in Pelle\u2019s sketch book. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal UI to be fully immersed in Pelle's world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3284200?t=1772727601","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772727601","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/fc194fb6eeb3210672df0eb87b30363ca5f7b216/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772727601","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/fc194fb6eeb3210672df0eb87b30363ca5f7b216/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772727601","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4159740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/d89ceebb315560be529e73bfb7b572f8.avif?t=1772727601\" width=1128 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plunge into a colorful, relaxing cleaning adventure in Muri: Wildwoods! Explore a mysterious island, uncover secrets, befriend cute creatures, clean away corruption, save the island\u2019s forest spirit, and restore the world\u2019s beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/f3ed978bacc0568aae7de186cfdffdc6.poster.avif?t=1772727601\" width=1170 height